    },
    "message": "Run the offline CI on Linux, Windows and macOS\n\nThe workflow tested Linux only, one test at a time. It now runs the same\noffline tests on ubuntu, windows and macos runners in parallel workers,\nkeeps each platform's test results, and lints once on Linux. It is still\nstarted by hand while the other platforms' failures are sorted out.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
