    "message": "Stop real-time scanning on the Windows CI runner\n\nThe runner's Defender scans every file the tests write, and a Run's saves\nwrite thousands. The step runs only on the disposable CI machine.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
